        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in festive spirit with <i>Look and Find - Christmas,</i> a hand-crafted hidden object game. <br>Unwind, explore stunningly realistic scenes, and experience the joy of the Christmas season, from the creators of <i>Look and Find - Curiosity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwind with Festive Scenes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast collection of cozy Christmas levels. Traverse warmly decorated environments, explore charming festive houses, and peek into bustling holiday workshops. Every scene is packed with intricate details and Christmas charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226520/extras/8430b747d41013d1c3fb7b18f62c5cbc.avif?t=1766476169\" width=626 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for Hidden Objects:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level challenges you to find 12 cleverly hidden Christmas items, culminating in a challenging search for the<strong> Christmas Star.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226520/extras/6236ac8701f419df678d50c81cbbe3c2.avif?t=1766476169\" width=626 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Rewards &amp; Unlock New Challenges:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you find has a value, adding to your festive reward total. Hunt for the elusive <strong>Christmas Star</strong> in each level for a big bonus! Use your earnings to unlock new, more challenging scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226520/extras/5410a0bf3a710e6d8b5c350c64ab8665.avif?t=1766476169\" width=626 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a Cozy and Relaxing World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for relaxation and that &quot;aha!&quot; moment of discovery. Whether you have five minutes or an hour, dive into a stress-free, festive world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted, realistic scenes</strong> offering enjoyable festive exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rewarding progression loop</strong>: Find items, earn rewards, and unlock new levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find each level's hidden<strong> Christmas Star</strong> for an extra challenge and reward!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate <strong>relaxing and cozy</strong> holiday vibe. Perfect for de-stressing!</p></li></ul>",
